OL,3,ADeath toll rises in Ukraine after
OL,4,ARussia attacks aid centre, hospice and
OL,5,Ahospital
OL,6,
OL,7,FRussian strikes on Ukraine ` including
OL,8,Fon an aid centre, a hospice and a
OL,9,Fhospital ` have killed at least 38
OL,10,Fcivilians and injured scores of others
OL,11,Fover the last 24 hours.
OL,13,FAt least 33 people are known to have
OL,14,Fdied in a glide bomb attack in the
OL,15,Fsouthern Zaporizhzhia region on Monday
OL,16,Fnight, and President Volodymyr Zelensky
OL,17,Fsaid the number of victims was set to
OL,18,Frise as more than 50 people could be
OL,19,Ftrapped under the rubble.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
