OL,3,ADeath toll rises in Ukraine after
OL,4,ARussia attacks aid centre, hospice and
OL,5,Ahospital
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe called the strike in Komyshuvakha
OL,8,Fvillage "one of the largest mass
OL,9,Fkillings committed by Russia during
OL,10,Fthis war".
OL,12,FUkraine had proposed to extend and
OL,13,Fexpand last week's ceasefire in the
OL,14,FKherson region which allowed people
OL,15,Ffrom the frontline Russian-occupied
OL,16,Ftown of Oleshky to evacuate, Zelensky
OL,17,Fadded.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
